description:
Share in a story circle led by artist and researcher Marcella Williams (Ngāti Porou, Ngāti Kahungungu, Samoan) as she shares the journey of exploration and discovery behind her exhibition 'Atua Wāhine ki te Rangi'.&nbsp;
Discover how she chose to breathe life into the purākau (stories) of these atua wāhine through her art. Open to all.
This event is part of the Atua Wāhine ki te Rangi art exhibition, ongoing at Mt Albert Library from 18 June - 17 July 2026.
